# Frontend Rules

Preserve Expo Go compatibility and React Native constraints.

For V3 UI, use `@/lib/design` and `@/components/vault`. Check existing vault components before building new UI.

Keep state boundaries clear: screen orchestration in screens, reusable display in components, API calls in `lib/api/*` unless an existing pattern says otherwise.

Handle loading, empty, error, retry, safe area, keyboard, and long text where relevant.

Do not fork vault components. Extend existing components or discuss the tradeoff first.
